  <title>
    <media type="image" width="40px" height="40px" its:translate="no" src="figures/orca-logo.svg" /> Clipboard
  </title>
  <p>
    Orca can present text copied to the system clipboard.
  </p>
  <p>
    Orca uses the desktop clipboard service when possible, such as Klipper or GPaste. If no
    supported service is available, Orca falls back to GTK clipboard support, which may be
    limited on Wayland.
  </p>
